WEBVTT

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:35.451
Support Admin Watch on
kissasia.cam or kisskh.org

00:00:46.813 --> 00:00:49.065
I heard the lawyer that
would represent

00:00:49.065 --> 00:00:50.358
Don Mariano in court...

00:00:50.858 --> 00:00:53.569
Was appointed by
General Seleno himself.

00:00:53.569 --> 00:00:56.572
I sense that they will
deliberately lose his case.

00:00:56.572 --> 00:00:57.740
- Sonya? Sonya!
- Wait...

00:00:57.740 --> 00:00:58.658
Are you alright?

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:00.451
My wife is pregnant.

00:01:00.451 --> 00:01:02.829
I was on my way
to the festivities, Ignacio

00:01:03.287 --> 00:01:04.580
when Helena
stopped me.

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:06.916
Now I think
she did it on purpose.

00:01:06.916 --> 00:01:10.002
Don Mariano is
hereby sentenced...

00:01:10.002 --> 00:01:11.212
To death.

00:01:13.089 --> 00:01:14.382
And don't be worried.

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:17.969
I am ready
to face my fate.

00:01:17.969 --> 00:01:20.555
Remember,
there are battles we lose.

00:01:20.555 --> 00:01:24.559
But when you fall,
that doesn't mean

00:01:24.559 --> 00:01:27.311
you won't get back up
again and continue fighting.

00:01:28.229 --> 00:01:29.413
I promise.

00:01:29.438 --> 00:01:31.315
I will never
leave your side.

00:01:31.649 --> 00:01:34.485
You are summoned
by Judge Valenciano

00:01:34.485 --> 00:01:35.278
at the town hall.

00:01:35.278 --> 00:01:37.488
He revealed that
you were the one who schemed

00:01:38.114 --> 00:01:43.369
The fake news
about Don Mariano

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:44.871
being involved with the rebels.

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:46.539
Your presence is expected.

00:03:53.457 --> 00:03:58.713
We ask Don Alejandro to
remove his clothes as well...

00:03:59.048 --> 00:04:03.636
and to prove the statements
made by Captain Corpuz.

00:04:04.218 --> 00:04:06.053
That it was in fact, Don Alejandro,

00:04:06.053 --> 00:04:08.472
who convinced them...

00:04:09.015 --> 00:04:11.642
To mark themselves with an X...

00:04:13.269 --> 00:04:15.563
As a sign of their settlement.

00:04:58.272 --> 00:05:03.194
It is true that Mr. Pipoy
is with the rebels.

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:05.821
When I learned that...

00:05:06.906 --> 00:05:09.533
I asked help from General Sergio.

00:05:14.121 --> 00:05:15.175
But...

00:05:16.123 --> 00:05:17.917
He raped...

00:05:18.876 --> 00:05:20.503
and abused me.

00:05:29.804 --> 00:05:31.430
Sergio, defend yourself.

00:05:45.861 --> 00:05:47.905
Yes, I admit it.

00:05:48.989 --> 00:05:51.867
I raped and abused Cristeta.

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:08.384
Captain Pedro Corpuz

00:06:08.384 --> 00:06:10.886
and General Sergio Alfonso...

00:06:11.303 --> 00:06:14.181
are sentenced by this court...

00:06:15.307 --> 00:06:16.433
To death.

00:06:36.537 --> 00:06:38.664
All of them are angry at Don Alejandro.

00:06:39.039 --> 00:06:42.501
And maybe, that's how
Juanito feels about me too.

00:07:42.603 --> 00:07:46.774
Miss, it's been days since
you last ate something.

00:07:46.774 --> 00:07:49.818
Do you want me to bring you food in here?

00:07:50.986 --> 00:07:52.154
I am not hungry.

00:07:56.075 --> 00:07:57.243
Teresita...

00:08:01.288 --> 00:08:04.959
The letters I've sent to Juanito...

00:08:07.002 --> 00:08:08.128
Did he answer any of them?

00:08:08.462 --> 00:08:09.588
Even just one?

00:08:12.883 --> 00:08:13.884
Miss,

00:08:14.468 --> 00:08:16.387
I'm really sorry, but...

00:08:17.221 --> 00:08:20.391
Mr. Juanito hasn't replied
to any of your letters.

00:08:21.642 --> 00:08:24.520
Even after General Sergio

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:26.814
and Captain Corpuz were executed last week,

00:08:27.189 --> 00:08:31.026
The civil guards are still
closely watching the Alfonso family.

00:08:31.026 --> 00:08:34.113
No one has been out of their hacienda.

00:08:37.992 --> 00:08:40.452
They didn't even see Sergio's body.

00:08:42.162 --> 00:08:44.164
Even Mr. Ignacio,

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:47.835
He wasn't allowed to see his father's body.

00:08:50.713 --> 00:08:53.882
They are bound to leave San Alfonso today.

00:08:54.341 --> 00:08:56.552
They'll be exiled to a far away place.

00:08:56.927 --> 00:08:59.680
No one knows where except the judges.

00:09:02.725 --> 00:09:04.852
I need to see Juanito...

00:09:06.645 --> 00:09:08.647
Just once...

00:09:09.106 --> 00:09:10.691
for the last time.

00:09:12.234 --> 00:09:13.193
Miss...

00:09:18.324 --> 00:09:19.867
Even just once.

00:09:30.252 --> 00:09:32.713
Let the children go to the pier.

00:09:32.713 --> 00:09:35.799
They just want to bid
farewell to their friends.

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:39.261
No one will leave this house.

00:09:39.928 --> 00:09:41.430
Anyone who disobeys me

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:44.224
will suffer great consequences.

00:09:58.864 --> 00:10:00.949
Please consider your children.

00:10:02.493 --> 00:10:04.078
I don't need to consider anyone.

00:10:07.581 --> 00:10:11.043
Miss, would you like me
to deliver your message

00:10:11.043 --> 00:10:12.252
to Mr. Juanito instead?

00:10:12.252 --> 00:10:14.296
No. I must do it. But...

00:10:14.505 --> 00:10:17.633
How do we leave when Father's here?

00:10:19.385 --> 00:10:20.219
You're always acting like this.

00:10:20.219 --> 00:10:22.096
Don't you feel pity for your children?

00:10:22.096 --> 00:10:23.305
Get out of here.

00:10:23.972 --> 00:10:24.890
Leave me be.

00:10:27.142 --> 00:10:28.769
If I'm not mistaken,

00:10:28.769 --> 00:10:32.481
before, didn't you leave
the house through the...

00:10:32.481 --> 00:10:33.440
Window!

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:51.768
Even in the last seconds,

00:11:52.186 --> 00:11:54.938
I hoped he will turn and see me.

00:11:55.522 --> 00:11:56.982
But he didn't.

00:11:57.608 --> 00:11:59.234
He didn't even look at me.

00:12:28.347 --> 00:12:30.724
I won't ever see Juanito again.

00:12:31.225 --> 00:12:34.770
I didn't even get to say how I truly feel.

00:13:27.573 --> 00:13:30.450
Under the orders of the Governor-General,

00:13:31.034 --> 00:13:33.912
who represents the empire of Spain...

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:35.956
From this day forward,

00:13:36.582 --> 00:13:40.752
14th of October, 1891.

00:13:41.461 --> 00:13:44.298
The new officer-in-charge
of San Alfonso would be..

00:13:45.173 --> 00:13:47.759
Governor Vicente Flores.

00:13:54.182 --> 00:13:55.976
I would still continue

00:13:55.976 --> 00:13:58.103
the plans and projects of the Alfonsos.

00:13:58.895 --> 00:14:01.690
After all, they served our
town for quite a long time.

00:14:02.482 --> 00:14:03.525
In line with this,

00:14:04.276 --> 00:14:06.862
I appoint General Seleno Salvacion

00:14:07.487 --> 00:14:12.200
as head of the peace corps
and leader of the civil guards.

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:15.621
Even though the General couldn't be here...

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:19.666
Due to an important meeting in Manila...

00:14:20.417 --> 00:14:21.752
Instead let us give a warm welcome

00:14:22.919 --> 00:14:24.254
to our new judge.

00:14:25.088 --> 00:14:27.341
Judge Maximo Rosalejos.

00:14:31.261 --> 00:14:32.304
What's happening?

00:14:32.929 --> 00:14:35.891
I feel like this is all wrong.

00:14:36.933 --> 00:14:39.519
And as the newly-appointed governor...

00:14:39.519 --> 00:14:42.564
I'd like to give recognition

00:14:43.065 --> 00:14:47.277
to someone who has
provided jobs and livelihoods.

00:14:47.277 --> 00:14:49.363
And has been the reason behind
the booming economy of our town.

00:14:49.863 --> 00:14:51.255
My fellow citizens,

00:14:51.615 --> 00:14:53.867
let us give him a round of applause.

00:14:55.702 --> 00:14:57.245
The one who shall be my right-hand man.

00:14:59.039 --> 00:15:03.877
The second most powerful
official in San Alfonso.

00:15:05.462 --> 00:15:07.547
Don Alejandro Montecarlos.

00:15:09.091 --> 00:15:10.425
Thank you, my friend.

00:15:11.385 --> 00:15:13.053
Thank you, thank you.

00:15:21.019 --> 00:15:22.813
Is it possible that they both conspired

00:15:22.813 --> 00:15:24.981
to bring down the
Alfonso family?

00:15:47.546 --> 00:15:48.505
And another thing,

00:15:48.505 --> 00:15:50.549
There's nothing written in the diary

00:15:50.549 --> 00:15:52.718
about Don Alejandro becoming an official

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:56.138
Did destiny really change?

00:15:57.013 --> 00:15:59.349
I need to talk to Mother Olivia.

00:15:59.683 --> 00:16:00.492
But...

00:16:00.517 --> 00:16:03.395
She went somewhere nobody knows where.

00:16:06.579 --> 00:16:07.607
Carmelita.

00:16:09.609 --> 00:16:10.743
Maria.

00:16:10.819 --> 00:16:12.738
Sleep evades me.

00:16:13.155 --> 00:16:14.196
How about you?

00:16:21.545 --> 00:16:23.046
I have a lot on my mind.

00:16:26.168 --> 00:16:28.044
So much happened one after another.

00:16:29.588 --> 00:16:30.922
Changes.

00:16:33.175 --> 00:16:34.509
And people we have lost.

00:16:38.597 --> 00:16:40.640
I don't know what to feel.

00:16:52.944 --> 00:16:55.405
I can sense you are worried for Juanito.

00:17:00.744 --> 00:17:02.579
But you should probably accept

00:17:02.579 --> 00:17:04.414
that maybe you're not
meant for one another.

00:17:06.958 --> 00:17:10.045
How would you know if
someone is not meant for you?

00:17:15.812 --> 00:17:17.438
There are many...

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:21.056
Obstacles that can stop two
people from loving each other.

00:17:22.599 --> 00:17:24.184
Aside from the strength

00:17:24.184 --> 00:17:26.686
and resilience of their
affection for one another.

00:17:30.565 --> 00:17:33.527
Relationships must also depend on destiny.

00:17:36.822 --> 00:17:37.781
Yes...

00:17:39.032 --> 00:17:40.492
Juanito loves you.

00:17:42.327 --> 00:17:44.496
And that is also how you feel.

00:17:46.623 --> 00:17:48.625
But you're separated from each other now.

00:17:51.545 --> 00:17:53.547
You don't even know where he is.

00:17:55.465 --> 00:17:58.426
Their family are considered criminals.

00:18:01.346 --> 00:18:02.681
And in no circumstance...

00:18:04.391 --> 00:18:08.353
Will Father ever agree
to let you marry Juanito.

00:18:15.819 --> 00:18:16.820
Carmelita.

00:18:19.322 --> 00:18:21.658
What you feel for Juanito...

00:18:25.161 --> 00:18:27.539
will just bring pain

00:18:28.123 --> 00:18:29.332
and conflict.

00:18:39.759 --> 00:18:42.137
How about you and Eduardo?

00:18:44.681 --> 00:18:47.058
Do you think you're meant for each other?

00:18:54.274 --> 00:18:56.443
I knew right from the start,

00:18:56.985 --> 00:18:59.738
that Eduardo and I aren't
going to end up with each other.

00:19:02.449 --> 00:19:04.951
Father will never agree

00:19:04.951 --> 00:19:06.995
to let me marry someone...

00:19:08.747 --> 00:19:10.165
Ordinary.

00:19:12.375 --> 00:19:14.461
But I also know that you're aware...

00:19:17.756 --> 00:19:21.051
The heart doesn't
really listen to the mind.

00:19:23.762 --> 00:19:26.514
I still followed what my heart wants.

00:19:31.994 --> 00:19:33.104
But now...

00:19:35.065 --> 00:19:38.360
I finally realized that
we're not for each other.

00:20:00.799 --> 00:20:02.008
Beautiful, isn't it?

00:20:03.218 --> 00:20:05.303
Oh no, there's a dead body!

00:20:05.303 --> 00:20:07.555
- Good Lord!
- Who could that be?

00:20:07.555 --> 00:20:12.185
- They found it in the river.
- Who was it? It was found in the river.

00:20:13.019 --> 00:20:15.271
- Go ahead.
- Yes, General.

00:20:15.271 --> 00:20:18.108
That poor soul. Who could it be?

00:20:18.108 --> 00:20:20.652
Good day to you, Miss Carmelita.

00:20:21.111 --> 00:20:22.654
What happened? Why is there a dead body?

00:20:23.905 --> 00:20:26.199
The body was found on the riverbank.

00:20:27.701 --> 00:20:29.494
General Seleno isn't here right now

00:20:29.494 --> 00:20:31.162
that's why I was the one
who received the report.

00:20:35.208 --> 00:20:36.751
When did you get promoted to General?

00:20:38.545 --> 00:20:40.005
My rank was promoted

00:20:40.005 --> 00:20:42.549
when I went to Cavite with General Sergio.

00:20:42.799 --> 00:20:43.925
Before he got arrested and...

00:20:44.509 --> 00:20:46.219
Taken back here to San Alfonso.

00:20:49.347 --> 00:20:51.641
General Leandro! Cristeta's still alive!

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:54.519
It was Cristeta who was found in the river?

00:21:09.909 --> 00:21:11.911
Miss, I should go.

00:21:12.245 --> 00:21:13.371
Take her to the hospital!

00:21:13.997 --> 00:21:15.055
Quickly!

00:21:18.918 --> 00:21:20.378
She needs to survive.

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:25.050
She's the only one who can prove that

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:28.094
Don Mariano, Sergio Alfonso,
and Captain Corpuz weren't rebels.

00:21:28.094 --> 00:21:30.889
In doing so, absolving
Juanito's name as well.

00:21:34.392 --> 00:21:36.394
I lied.

00:21:39.522 --> 00:21:41.357
It wasn't true that...

00:21:42.108 --> 00:21:46.279
Mr. Sergio ever abused me.

00:21:50.742 --> 00:21:53.620
We have feelings for each other.

00:21:55.663 --> 00:21:58.374
And something already happened between us.

00:22:02.087 --> 00:22:03.112
But...

00:22:03.546 --> 00:22:05.382
When I heard that...

00:22:07.008 --> 00:22:09.052
He was already arranged...

00:22:09.886 --> 00:22:11.763
To get married to someone else.

00:22:13.389 --> 00:22:14.440
That's why...

00:22:15.016 --> 00:22:19.145
I testified against him.

00:22:23.031 --> 00:22:27.994
Mr. Maximo promised me a new home,

00:22:28.613 --> 00:22:30.490
somewhere far away.

00:22:32.450 --> 00:22:35.328
And he also bribed...

00:22:36.079 --> 00:22:37.372
Mr. Pipoy

00:22:37.831 --> 00:22:39.833
to testify

00:22:40.917 --> 00:22:44.587
against Don Mariano.

00:22:49.050 --> 00:22:50.182
But...

00:22:50.385 --> 00:22:52.220
he murdered

00:22:52.637 --> 00:22:54.191
Mr. Pipoy after.

00:22:59.269 --> 00:23:00.687
I can feel...

00:23:04.774 --> 00:23:06.568
...that I'll be next.

00:23:09.279 --> 00:23:10.280
That's why...

00:23:11.614 --> 00:23:13.741
I did the act myself.

00:23:18.413 --> 00:23:24.002
I finally tricked those bastards.

00:23:35.889 --> 00:23:36.959
Cristeta...

00:23:40.393 --> 00:23:41.644
Cristeta?

00:23:45.106 --> 00:23:46.357
Cristeta?

00:23:53.406 --> 00:23:54.608
Help!

00:23:54.866 --> 00:23:55.925
Cristeta?

00:23:55.950 --> 00:23:56.868
Help!

00:23:56.868 --> 00:23:58.068
Help!

00:23:58.411 --> 00:23:59.204
Cristeta!

00:23:59.204 --> 00:24:00.121
Cristeta?

00:24:00.330 --> 00:24:01.372
Help!

00:24:01.372 --> 00:24:02.248
Help!

00:24:02.248 --> 00:24:02.957
Help!

00:24:02.957 --> 00:24:04.125
Help!

00:24:04.959 --> 00:24:06.019
Cristeta!

00:24:06.044 --> 00:24:07.100
Cristeta!

00:24:07.545 --> 00:24:08.796
Cristeta?

00:24:11.799 --> 00:24:12.967
Help!

00:24:29.776 --> 00:24:31.027
Help!

00:24:43.039 --> 00:24:44.290
Cristeta...?

00:24:49.212 --> 00:24:52.465
- Carmelita! Let's talk at home.
- Cristeta?!

00:24:54.425 --> 00:24:55.276
Come on!

00:24:55.301 --> 00:24:58.429
- I'm so sorry, Father!
- Alejandro!

00:24:58.680 --> 00:25:00.848
- Alejandro! Please stop!
- Father!

00:25:00.848 --> 00:25:02.016
Stop this, please!

00:25:03.017 --> 00:25:04.852
Father, don't! Please!

00:25:06.479 --> 00:25:08.815
Alejandro! That's enough...

00:25:09.816 --> 00:25:12.443
You always go against my word, Carmelita!

00:25:14.070 --> 00:25:16.239
What were you doing at the hospital?!

00:25:16.239 --> 00:25:18.032
And why were you talking to the girl

00:25:18.032 --> 00:25:20.702
who testified against the Alfonsos?!

00:25:22.745 --> 00:25:24.122
Father...

00:25:24.122 --> 00:25:27.542
Why did the mark disappear from your back?

00:25:29.544 --> 00:25:30.920
Are you saying...

00:25:31.212 --> 00:25:34.173
That I had a hand in their
deaths and imprisonment?!

00:25:35.967 --> 00:25:37.343
Why did you stay quiet?

00:25:37.802 --> 00:25:40.138
When Don Mariano was sentenced, why?

00:25:41.556 --> 00:25:42.682
Carmelita...

00:25:42.682 --> 00:25:45.476
Captain Corpuz said that...

00:25:45.912 --> 00:25:47.520
You reconciled with them,

00:25:47.520 --> 00:25:50.565
and that you all had the mark
in your back at the same time.

00:25:50.565 --> 00:25:52.025
As a symbol of your friendship.

00:25:52.025 --> 00:25:53.484
Carmelita!

00:25:54.068 --> 00:25:56.988
Stop right now! Do not accuse your father!

00:25:57.488 --> 00:25:58.656
And now...

00:25:58.656 --> 00:26:01.951
You're believing Corpuz's
lies more than me?!

00:26:02.660 --> 00:26:04.329
That's enough, Alejandro...

00:26:07.540 --> 00:26:10.001
There's only one telling the truth, Father.

00:26:11.753 --> 00:26:14.922
And I have proven now, that you...

00:26:15.423 --> 00:26:16.841
You're lying.

00:26:19.260 --> 00:26:20.803
Father, no! Please don't!

00:26:22.013 --> 00:26:24.140
Please have mercy! Stop, Father!

00:26:26.017 --> 00:26:27.518
Enough!

00:26:27.904 --> 00:26:31.230
Stop hurting your children!

00:26:52.251 --> 00:26:54.587
General Leandro came here earlier.

00:26:55.880 --> 00:26:57.965
He wants to talk to Carmelita.

00:26:59.550 --> 00:27:00.635
What did you say?

00:27:02.178 --> 00:27:03.346
I asked him to leave.

00:27:04.555 --> 00:27:06.349
I told him this isn't the right time.

00:27:08.393 --> 00:27:09.852
But maybe it is time.

00:27:10.269 --> 00:27:12.313
If they truly love each other,

00:27:12.313 --> 00:27:14.273
why should we stop them?

00:27:19.112 --> 00:27:20.363
Alejandro!

00:27:22.156 --> 00:27:25.743
I don't know what's happening
to our daughter, but I think..

00:27:26.077 --> 00:27:29.122
Marriage with straighten her life out.

00:27:39.132 --> 00:27:40.716
I miss him already.

00:27:41.134 --> 00:27:43.136
Maybe if he was here,

00:27:43.344 --> 00:27:45.513
everything will be easier for me.

00:27:45.847 --> 00:27:51.436
Everything feels better
whenever I see his smile.

00:28:05.116 --> 00:28:09.704
For me, that's the most
beautiful poem I have ever read.

00:28:14.083 --> 00:28:15.376
Carmelita, my dear.

00:28:15.835 --> 00:28:18.087
Please understand your father.

00:28:18.880 --> 00:28:21.841
You know he has a very short temper

00:28:21.841 --> 00:28:23.551
and he has a heart condition.

00:28:25.511 --> 00:28:27.972
I hope you could understand
that he's human too.

00:28:29.098 --> 00:28:32.643
He got hurt with your accusations.

00:28:41.652 --> 00:28:44.489
Mr. Leandro visited earlier, by the way.

00:28:44.489 --> 00:28:47.325
I mean, General Leandro.

00:28:47.742 --> 00:28:51.496
I asked him to return another day.

00:28:51.787 --> 00:28:54.499
I know you're still not feeling well.

00:28:57.251 --> 00:28:58.753
Dear,

00:28:58.753 --> 00:29:00.505
I hope you understand.

00:29:01.631 --> 00:29:03.424
Your Father and I only wish

00:29:03.449 --> 00:29:06.702
for the best interests
of you and your sisters,

00:29:07.261 --> 00:29:09.096
I hope you can open your mind

00:29:09.096 --> 00:29:13.184
and see that we only wish for your safety.

00:29:17.438 --> 00:29:21.067
Your Father and I agreed to
push through with your wedding.

00:29:21.067 --> 00:29:23.361
My wedding to Juanito will push through?!

00:29:24.378 --> 00:29:29.342
So that you may know the
responsibilities of a mother and a parent.

00:29:29.390 --> 00:29:31.725
And that your days may be filled with it.

00:29:33.663 --> 00:29:38.167
I knew you'll be glad to hear that news.

00:29:39.669 --> 00:29:42.129
Now I'm sure that you do love him.

00:29:44.173 --> 00:29:46.050
Very well, you rest early.

00:29:46.342 --> 00:29:49.971
Tomorrow, General Leandro
and Governor Flores will be back.

00:29:51.970 --> 00:29:53.095
What?

00:29:53.239 --> 00:29:54.949
I am to be engaged to Leandro?

00:30:01.566 --> 00:30:03.276
Carmelita, dear? Wait!

00:30:07.613 --> 00:30:08.614
Father.

00:30:09.740 --> 00:30:11.242
I do not want to get married.

00:30:11.242 --> 00:30:12.702
Please take back your word.

00:30:15.538 --> 00:30:16.872
And why are you unwilling?

00:30:18.541 --> 00:30:20.876
Didn't you scheme with Juanito

00:30:20.876 --> 00:30:22.878
just so you could stop your wedding?

00:30:24.463 --> 00:30:27.300
You also helped him get
closer to Helena Flores...

00:30:27.300 --> 00:30:30.261
And you told every single one of us

00:30:30.261 --> 00:30:33.306
that it is Leandro you love.

00:30:35.224 --> 00:30:37.685
It's true that I didn't want
the wedding to happen

00:30:37.685 --> 00:30:39.520
for the sake of Juanito.

00:30:39.854 --> 00:30:42.440
But I don't have any feelings for Leandro.

00:30:46.569 --> 00:30:47.737
Answer me.

00:30:48.613 --> 00:30:51.782
Why are you opposing this engagement?

00:30:58.706 --> 00:31:01.292
- Because...
- Carmelita, dear.

00:31:02.001 --> 00:31:03.919
Please don't take this any further.

00:31:06.127 --> 00:31:09.002
I really don’t know what
else to do with you, Carmelita.

00:31:12.553 --> 00:31:14.013
Can't you see?

00:31:15.556 --> 00:31:17.016
I did this

00:31:17.016 --> 00:31:19.560
because I'm trying to look out for you.

00:31:20.144 --> 00:31:23.147
Because I want you to be happy.

00:31:23.773 --> 00:31:27.234
Even though you are filled
with hatred and doubt for me.

00:31:27.234 --> 00:31:30.696
I still did it because that
is what good fathers do.

00:31:34.158 --> 00:31:37.620
Because I want to be a good father to you.

00:31:43.876 --> 00:31:46.462
But it seems your heart is already set.

00:31:49.840 --> 00:31:51.842
Where is my youngest daughter?

00:31:53.678 --> 00:31:55.638
Where is my sweet Carmelita?

00:31:55.888 --> 00:31:57.515
Who was full of affection?

00:31:57.848 --> 00:32:00.559
Loving and always obedient to me?!

00:32:05.606 --> 00:32:06.732
Why?

00:32:09.985 --> 00:32:11.278
Why does it seem like...

00:32:12.822 --> 00:32:15.533
I don’t know the person
I’m looking at anymore?

00:32:17.326 --> 00:32:18.327
Why?

00:32:19.620 --> 00:32:21.455
I apologize, Father.

00:32:22.540 --> 00:32:24.166
I'm still not ready yet.

00:32:24.458 --> 00:32:26.419
I don't want to get married.

00:32:45.855 --> 00:32:48.190
I know that there's
nothing written in the diary.

00:32:48.482 --> 00:32:51.986
And Carmelita and Leandro
aren't meant to be married.

00:33:00.536 --> 00:33:01.611
Miss.

00:33:01.912 --> 00:33:03.198
Where are you going?

00:33:03.372 --> 00:33:04.540
Are you headed somewhere?

00:33:04.540 --> 00:33:05.875
You're leaving me too?

00:33:06.375 --> 00:33:07.377
What?

00:33:07.793 --> 00:33:10.546
I wouldn't leave you even if I could, Miss.

00:33:10.880 --> 00:33:13.507
Don't worry, it's not
just me who's leaving.

00:33:13.507 --> 00:33:14.800
You'll be leaving as well!

00:33:15.342 --> 00:33:18.012
So go ahead and dress
up, so that's we won't be late

00:33:18.012 --> 00:33:20.097
to the ship heading to Sugbu.

00:33:20.890 --> 00:33:22.516
What are you saying?

00:33:23.684 --> 00:33:26.854
Didn't Miss Maria and
Miss Josefina tell you?

00:33:29.254 --> 00:33:30.422
Oh, and by the way,

00:33:30.775 --> 00:33:34.695
your parents left early with your sisters.

00:33:35.362 --> 00:33:39.033
They're attending the
feast of Governor Flores.

00:33:39.241 --> 00:33:42.703
You were not woken up because
today is also our departure

00:33:42.703 --> 00:33:44.914
with Mother Olivia to Sugbu.

00:33:44.914 --> 00:33:45.986
Our departure?

00:33:46.707 --> 00:33:47.792
Towards Sugbu?

00:33:48.250 --> 00:33:49.084
That's right.

00:33:49.084 --> 00:33:52.963
Last night, Mother Olivia
talked to Don Alejandro.

00:33:52.963 --> 00:33:56.675
She said you needed more time to think.

00:33:56.675 --> 00:33:59.553
Especially after everything
that has happened and,

00:33:59.553 --> 00:34:03.140
that you were deeply saddened
when the Alfonsos were exiled.

00:34:03.140 --> 00:34:04.975
A family that has become close to you.

00:34:05.267 --> 00:34:07.686
That's why Don Alejandro
agreed

00:34:07.686 --> 00:34:10.356
to let you stay in Sugbu for two weeks.

00:34:10.940 --> 00:34:13.400
Before finally setting up a date

00:34:13.400 --> 00:34:15.277
for your wedding to General Leandro.

00:34:17.655 --> 00:34:18.906
Why are you happy about it?

00:34:20.658 --> 00:34:25.329
Mother Olivia requested that I join you

00:34:25.329 --> 00:34:27.957
so that you won't get too lonely, Miss.

00:34:39.051 --> 00:34:40.928
I will have our belongings loaded first.

00:34:41.512 --> 00:34:42.847
Mother Olivia.

00:34:45.683 --> 00:34:47.101
Where have you been?

00:34:47.351 --> 00:34:50.271
Why didn't you tell me
where you'll be going?

00:34:50.271 --> 00:34:51.413
My dear...

00:34:51.438 --> 00:34:54.066
I settled an important thing.

00:34:54.733 --> 00:34:55.734
What's important now...

00:34:56.402 --> 00:34:59.113
Is that I was able to take you away
from Don Alejandro even just for a while.

00:35:04.510 --> 00:35:06.512
We have to do something

00:35:06.537 --> 00:35:09.248
to stop your wedding to Leandro Flores

00:35:10.207 --> 00:35:11.458
What should we do?

00:35:14.420 --> 00:35:15.921
I suspect that...

00:35:16.255 --> 00:35:18.716
Destiny has already changed its course.

00:35:20.259 --> 00:35:22.553
I don't know what's gonna happen next.

00:35:25.681 --> 00:35:26.708
But...

00:35:27.016 --> 00:35:28.642
There's one thing I know for sure.

00:35:30.561 --> 00:35:32.730
Make sure Juanito lives.

00:35:32.938 --> 00:35:34.315
That is your mission.

00:35:36.525 --> 00:35:40.362
The day of his death has changed,

00:35:40.362 --> 00:35:42.198
and that is what I fear the most.

00:35:54.919 --> 00:35:56.462
Mother Ofelia, good day to you.

00:35:56.462 --> 00:35:57.421
Good day to you as well.

00:35:57.421 --> 00:36:00.007
This is Carmelita and Theresita.

00:36:00.007 --> 00:36:02.718
It's a pleasure meeting
you, Miss Carmelita.

00:36:03.302 --> 00:36:06.013
And welcome to you as well, little miss.

00:36:09.099 --> 00:36:12.436
This is Mother Esperanza.

00:36:13.437 --> 00:36:14.464
Mother.

00:36:15.522 --> 00:36:16.660
Dear...

00:36:17.066 --> 00:36:19.109
You are also here to learn.

00:36:20.110 --> 00:36:21.278
Don't worry.

00:36:21.278 --> 00:36:22.655
We won't charge you.

00:36:22.655 --> 00:36:25.240
Just take care of Carmelita,

00:36:25.741 --> 00:36:28.494
with all your heart, that will be enough.

00:36:29.078 --> 00:36:30.621
Thank you very much.

00:36:31.455 --> 00:36:33.958
I will take our belongings
from the carriage.

00:36:34.308 --> 00:36:34.892
Thank you.

00:36:34.917 --> 00:36:36.755
- Mother Esperanza, please help her.
- Of course.

00:36:37.353 --> 00:36:40.189
Well, I'll call the other nuns to help you.

00:36:40.214 --> 00:36:41.382
We'll be waiting for them.

00:36:47.371 --> 00:36:49.873
You seem to be in good spirits.

00:36:51.600 --> 00:36:52.726
Maybe.

00:36:53.394 --> 00:36:54.728
I might just really need some

00:36:54.728 --> 00:36:56.772
time and space to not be stressed.

00:37:00.025 --> 00:37:01.443
Sometimes, dear...

00:37:02.611 --> 00:37:06.269
The more we take someone out of our mind...

00:37:07.873 --> 00:37:10.167
The more we can't forget them.

00:37:11.245 --> 00:37:13.122
The best way to solve that is...

00:37:14.248 --> 00:37:16.750
Not fighting what you feel.

00:37:19.336 --> 00:37:22.965
But Juanito and I can't
end up together, right?

00:37:24.842 --> 00:37:26.719
You weren't supposed
to fall in love with Juanito.

00:37:28.053 --> 00:37:30.389
But just like I've said...

00:37:31.140 --> 00:37:33.142
Destiny has changed its course.

00:37:34.393 --> 00:37:37.563
So, does that mean Juanito and I could...?

00:37:39.273 --> 00:37:40.607
Your mission...

00:37:41.608 --> 00:37:43.277
Is to save Juanito from dying.

00:37:43.652 --> 00:37:45.779
So that you can return to your own time.

00:37:47.489 --> 00:37:49.742
What do you think pushes a person

00:37:49.742 --> 00:37:52.202
to continue living?

00:37:55.748 --> 00:37:56.749
Love?

00:38:02.004 --> 00:38:03.464
If you think about it...

00:38:06.175 --> 00:38:07.676
Love is the reason why...

00:38:08.927 --> 00:38:13.223
The Lord Jesus Christ chose to die...

00:38:14.183 --> 00:38:16.518
In order to save us from our sins.

00:38:17.603 --> 00:38:20.064
Because He so loved us deeply.

00:38:24.109 --> 00:38:27.571
That is also the same for people
who is suffering immensely.

00:38:29.656 --> 00:38:31.075
Why do you think...

00:38:31.784 --> 00:38:33.243
They fight to live?

00:38:34.411 --> 00:38:36.121
And hold on to hope?

00:38:39.100 --> 00:38:43.045
It's because of all the people
who care and love them truly.

00:38:47.216 --> 00:38:48.300
Even though...

00:38:49.134 --> 00:38:53.097
humans are always making mistakes.

00:38:53.555 --> 00:38:57.059
The Lord always forgives us.

00:38:59.217 --> 00:39:01.146
Because the Lord loves us.

00:39:08.487 --> 00:39:09.613
Now...

00:39:10.823 --> 00:39:12.324
I truly understand.

00:39:13.909 --> 00:39:15.911
Why Juanito fell in love with you.

00:39:16.995 --> 00:39:19.665
Not because you're
pretending to be Carmelita.

00:39:21.458 --> 00:39:23.168
But because you...

00:39:24.128 --> 00:39:25.334
You...

00:39:25.421 --> 00:39:26.547
Are Carmela.

00:39:27.464 --> 00:39:29.133
He fell for the real you.

00:39:32.427 --> 00:39:35.305
Just like twins with identical faces...

00:39:38.100 --> 00:39:40.060
They still have differences.

00:39:42.187 --> 00:39:46.692
In appearance, you may be Carmelita.

00:39:49.111 --> 00:39:50.487
But when it comes to the heart...

00:39:52.281 --> 00:39:53.657
And the mind...

00:39:55.325 --> 00:39:57.035
You are Carmela.

00:40:01.123 --> 00:40:02.166
Now...

00:40:03.417 --> 00:40:06.170
Do you still doubt Juanito's feelings?

00:41:24.747 --> 00:41:26.419
- Miss Carmelita,
- Mm?

00:41:26.444 --> 00:41:28.208
there's something I need to tell you.

00:41:28.961 --> 00:41:29.975
What is it?

00:41:32.130 --> 00:41:34.508
I'm not sure, but...

00:41:34.841 --> 00:41:40.055
I think I saw Mr. Juanito at
the fish area in the market.

00:41:41.056 --> 00:41:42.182
Did he see you?

00:41:43.016 --> 00:41:44.476
I don't think so.

00:41:44.476 --> 00:41:46.895
I wanted to call him but

00:41:46.895 --> 00:41:48.981
I was with Mother Ofelia at the time.

00:41:50.065 --> 00:41:53.193
Maybe it wasn't him.

00:41:53.193 --> 00:41:56.947
How unlikely it is for us
to see Mr. Juanito here.

00:41:58.073 --> 00:41:59.616
Teresita, listen to me.

00:42:00.242 --> 00:42:01.994
That was really Juanito.

00:42:02.619 --> 00:42:04.162
I saw him yesterday.

00:42:06.122 --> 00:42:08.500
I'm sorry I didn't tell you.

00:42:09.334 --> 00:42:12.296
I wanted to keep it a
secret that he lives here.

00:42:13.046 --> 00:42:15.048
We have to be careful.

00:42:15.424 --> 00:42:19.553
If Father and Mother learn
that he was exiled here...

00:42:20.721 --> 00:42:23.473
They'll force us back to San Alfonso.

00:42:25.559 --> 00:42:27.185
What should we do?

00:42:45.912 --> 00:42:50.092
Miss, why don't we just
approach Mr. Juanito?

00:42:50.292 --> 00:42:51.770
I'm not ready to face him.

00:42:52.544 --> 00:42:53.628
Who are you?

00:42:53.795 --> 00:42:55.272
And where are you from?

00:42:55.297 --> 00:42:57.132
We are not bad people.

00:42:59.426 --> 00:43:02.763
A Tagalog from a wealthy family.

00:43:04.222 --> 00:43:05.256
Who are you?

00:43:05.474 --> 00:43:06.600
Why are you here?

00:43:10.729 --> 00:43:12.147
Are you spies?

00:43:21.907 --> 00:43:22.908
Father Caloy!

00:43:23.575 --> 00:43:26.119
They're daughters of the
family we serve in Bulacan.

00:43:33.585 --> 00:43:35.045
Please excuse them, Father Caloy.

00:43:36.046 --> 00:43:37.881
These ladies are our guests.

00:43:42.177 --> 00:43:43.224
Alright then.

00:43:43.929 --> 00:43:46.723
Don't let them roam around alone.

00:43:48.058 --> 00:43:49.434
They might get into trouble.

00:44:06.159 --> 00:44:08.370
I wanted to ask,
General Leandro.

00:44:08.370 --> 00:44:11.790
Are you and my daughter
really in love with each other?

00:44:11.790 --> 00:44:13.250
In love or not,

00:44:13.250 --> 00:44:16.211
we all know you need
this engagement more than us.

00:44:16.211 --> 00:44:18.130
To clean the
reputation of your daughter.

00:44:18.130 --> 00:44:19.172
Juanito!

00:44:20.424 --> 00:44:22.217
Can we just talk for a bit?

00:44:22.217 --> 00:44:23.844
I don't want to have
anything to do with you.

00:44:24.177 --> 00:44:25.053
Every time I see you,

00:44:25.053 --> 00:44:27.973
I remember the betrayal
your father did to our family.

00:44:28.265 --> 00:44:30.642
Just pretend we didn't meet.

00:44:31.268 --> 00:44:33.270
Juanito!

00:44:34.104 --> 00:44:35.188
It's Mother!

00:44:35.188 --> 00:44:36.565
No wedding shall happen

00:44:36.565 --> 00:44:38.984
between Carmelita and Leandro.

00:44:38.984 --> 00:44:41.903
I am here to inform all of you...

00:44:41.903 --> 00:44:45.907
That Carmelita decided
to be a servant of the church.

00:44:49.578 --> 00:44:50.579
- Father!
- Alejandro!

00:44:50.579 --> 00:44:52.205
I hope you promise

00:44:52.205 --> 00:44:56.626
that the mouse
will never leave his beloved cat.

00:44:56.626 --> 00:44:57.544
Carmelita,

00:44:57.544 --> 00:45:01.006
I hope you will
choose me in the end.